From: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:35:51 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] mm/damon/core: dereference after tail decrement (patch 13
 fixup)

Signed-off-by: SJ Park <sj@kernel.org>
---
 mm/damon/core.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/mm/damon/core.c b/mm/damon/core.c
index c79fc96128913..4aa4852f51035 100644
--- a/mm/damon/core.c
+++ b/mm/damon/core.c
@@ -2414,11 +2414,11 @@ bool damon_report_exist(enum damon_report_type report_type,
 		return false;
 	idx = queue->tail;
 	for (nr_read = 0; nr_read < queue->nr_reports; nr_read++) {
-		report = &queue->reports[idx];
 		if (idx)
 			idx--;
 		else
 			idx = queue->size - 1;
+		report = &queue->reports[idx];
 
 		if (time_before(report->jiffies, jiffies_old))
 			break;
-- 
2.47.3

